WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
Section 4.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:04.212
Vaccine Procurement.

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:16.012
Billions were spent signing advance purchase agreements across multiple manufacturers, yet the full per-dose pricing and delivery penalty terms remain shielded from parliamentary scrutiny to this day.
